### CHECKOUT TEST COMPLETE
### ============================================
### Covers:
### - Single item checkout
### - Multiple items checkout
### - Stock decrement verification
### - Empty cart error (400)
### - Invalid quantity error (400)
### - Non-existent product error (404)
### - Insufficient stock error (400)
### - Rollback verification (stock unchanged on failure)
